@startuml F0.7-d-assinatura-invalida
title F0.7-d — Assinatura ED25519 inválida
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Verificador" as Verificador
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "Web Crypto API" as Crypto
participant "CertificadoController" as Ctrl
participant "VerificarCertificadoUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Verificador -> WebApp: hash existente
WebApp -> Ctrl: GET certificado
Ctrl -> UC: execute(hash)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT certificado
Postgres --> UC: payload + assinatura
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 OK

WebApp -> WebApp: GET /.well-known/jwks.json
WebApp -> Crypto: SubtleCrypto.verify
Crypto --> WebApp: false

note right of WebApp
  JWKS é a fonte de verdade
  independente do 200 do backend
  RN-F0.7-05 / 06
end note

WebApp --> Verificador: "Certificado inválido"\n(sem dados do beneficiário)

@enduml
